WEBVTT

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:05.610 line:95%,end
Tidvis was founded to help healthcare providers deliver better care

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.440 line:95%,end
by making the administrative side easier.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:14.260 line:95%,end
Many of our customers say they spend an enormous amount of time on administration.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:20.100 line:95%,end
When they take in Tidvis, we make things easier and let them

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.900 line:95%,end
comply with legislation –

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.020 line:95%,end
for example when it comes to document handling in general.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:31.460 line:95%,end
We reduce the administrative burden on them enormously.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:36.490 line:95%,end
Tidvis is today a very healthy company with extremely satisfied customers.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.150 line:95%,end
We never lose any customers.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.740 line:95%,end
They are super happy that the systems work.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:49.210 line:95%,end
The cooperation with PubliX helps us handle the challenges we face,

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:51.130 line:95%,end
when it comes to growth, for example.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.510 line:95%,end
They help us with support systems for administrators,

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.123 line:95%,end
they help us with marketing, they help us with recruitment –

00:00:58.123 --> 00:01:00.710 line:95%,end
which can be very challenging for smaller companies.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:06.770 line:95%,end
At the same time, they support us a great deal with AI.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:09.990 line:95%,end
PubliX also helps us develop our staff's skills.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:15.170 line:95%,end
Just here today, the whole company is in Stockholm.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:25.190 line:95%,end
As CEO, it matters a lot to me that PubliX, as owner, invests in our people.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:29.850 line:95%,end
With the support and help we get from PubliX, I feel confident

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:32.770 line:95%,end
that we will reach the goals we have set.
